# url.redis
# This is NOT a real Redis file format — Redis has no native file extension.
# It documents the cache convention used by backend/*/repository/url.repository.js
# so the structure in your diagram is represented on disk.
#
# Key pattern:   url:short:<short_code>
# Value:         <long_url>
# TTL:           24h (refreshed on every read/write)
#
# Diagram shape:
#   {
#     long_url: short_url
#   }
#
# In code we key by short_code (not long_url) because redirects look up
# by short_code — this is the reverse-index of the dict shown in the diagram,
# chosen because GET /:short_code is the hot path that must be O(1).
